9L0BeAnJrPYFUcFIf_Cw&oe=6AFC75D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nSTPZuwdOz8Q7kNvwF9jszQ&_nc_oc=Adr6hhIRkCvy1VSU--uSSbTggJH0z_q30Qlo0Trbq6v2-gXr2H4NAwf81QvId1vQly0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSdcCBIu3du6Xqp6Aq4TbuGAy13_bfz7_ZQath477C2hw&oe=6AFC7B7C"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "6208190105926898"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036637_730466291957102_4986099473870612760_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Zoy7DKfn1kQ7kNvwENdNMC&_nc_oc=AdrgbQKBbyoNINBBsG91Gyju4VRoczomt_k7EJ_XpwKTlgvnI9CaUa02VbCoFLC3gX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAWAfmIseUKFEcTDavB3d5DBjR4dExF8kTRGcbJ8rFig&oe=6AFC88EB"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "My Room", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1679940335, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "6506167206094803", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "6506167196094804", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "940607870257979"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "984096085821538", "image_type": 